      "description": "You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is Heavily Obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind {such as one created by Gust of Wind) disperses it. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The fog's radius incr eases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "source": "http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/spell:fog-cloud"
    },
