        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "ritual": false,
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "description": "A loud noise erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius Sphere centered there makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d8 Thunder damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A Construct has Disadvantage on the save. A nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the spell's area. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage in creases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "source": "http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/spell:shatter"
    },
    {
      "id": "shining-smite",
