      "description": "The target hit by the strike takes an extr a 2d6 Radiant damage from the attack. Until the spell ends, the target sheds Bright Light in a 5 -foot radiu s, attack rolls against it have Advantage, and it can't benefit from the Invisible condition. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage in creases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.",
