      "description": "For the duration, no sound can be cre ated with in or pass through a 20-foot -radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or object entirely inside the Sphere has Immunity to Thunder damage, and creature s have the Deafened condition whil e entirely in:·ide it. Casting a spell that includes a Verba l compon ent is imp ossib le there. O F THE M U ND A N E /\\ NO THE WHIMSICAL",
      "source": "http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/spell:silence"
    },
    {
      "id": "spider-climb",
