      "description": "You brandi sh t:H! weapon used to cast the spell and choose a poit1t v-;ithin range. Hundreds of similar spect ral we::ipr.-rts (or ammunition appropriate to the weapo n) '.·:1 in a volley and then disappear. Each creature of your choice that you can see in a 40-foot-radius, 20-foot-high Cylinder centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw. A crea ture takes 8d8 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. P\"",
